\ The wrong twin of tests/front/s1-rfl.lf: 0 + 0 = 1 by rfl. Lean refuses
\ it at rfl, "Tactic `rfl` failed: The left-hand side ...", and nothing is
\ checked (tests/front/s1-rfl-wrong.lean); LeanForth stops at by-rfl with
\ error 97 and Lean's text, exit 4 (tests/front/check_elab.py).
theorem t
  0 0 + 1 =
:= by
  by-rfl
end t
